      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Known cycles:\nE2-RC01: E2-R-HOME -> E2-R-TRUST; broken-by-design-not-tested. RE07/RE08 expose the rejected guest-admin bootstrap. Recovery must use target cloud-only authority and\noffline custody, then prove separation with fresh and existing-session tests.\nIndependent anchors:\nE2-R-CUSTODY: independent of Orbit home IdP and administrators, Cross-tenant guest sign-in, Normal ticketing/password vault; still depends on Target Entra cloud\nauthentication, Custodian and supported method/device. Proof: Authorized R1 test in target tenant with source path not required; not executed.\nE2-R-BASE: independent of Transition tenant write access, Acquired admin credentials; still depends on Independent integrity/custody and current app grant inventory,\nTarget/cloud APIs for cleanup. Proof: Retrieve trusted graph and reconcile all relationships during approved separation; not executed.",
      "originalText": "Known cycles:\nE2-RC01: E2-R-HOME -> E2-R-TRUST; broken-by-design-not-tested. RE07/RE08 expose the rejected guest-admin bootstrap. Recovery must use target cloud-only authority and\noffline custody, then prove separation with fresh and existing-session tests.\nIndependent anchors:\nE2-R-CUSTODY: independent of Orbit home IdP and administrators, Cross-tenant guest sign-in, Normal ticketing/password vault; still depends on Target Entra cloud\nauthentication, Custodian and supported method/device. Proof: Authorized R1 test in target tenant with source path not required; not executed.\nE2-R-BASE: independent of Transition tenant write access, Acquired admin credentials; still depends on Independent integrity/custody and current app grant inventory,\nTarget/cloud APIs for cleanup. Proof: Retrieve trusted graph and reconcile all relationships during approved separation; not executed.",
